#!amber
SHADER compute main SPIRV-BIN FILE main.spv
BUFFER words DATA_TYPE uint32 DATA 305419896 4294901761 0 2147516415 END
BUFFER packed DATA_TYPE uint32 SIZE 12 FILL 7
PIPELINE compute p
  ATTACH main
  BIND BUFFER words AS storage DESCRIPTOR_SET 0 BINDING 0
  BIND BUFFER packed AS storage DESCRIPTOR_SET 0 BINDING 1
END
RUN p 1 1 1
EXPECT packed IDX 0 EQ 1450709556 2018915346 305485433 131071 16842751 2 0 0 65537 2147450880 4286513280 2147581952
